# Left out:
#
#   engine/src/models/dflash.cpp
#
# The drafter model.  It defines llama_model::load_arch_hparams,
# save_arch_hparams and load_arch_tensors, and engine/src/models/
# deepseek4.cpp defines the same three: two models, one set of methods,
# and a build takes one of them.  Linked together they refuse 238
# declarations where either alone refuses none, so this is the link
# answering correctly a question that should not have been asked.
